| `backend_python` | string | `>=3.10` | empty, or comma-separated clauses using `~=` `==` `!=` `<=` `>=` `<` `>` and up to three ASCII-digit parts; `~=` needs at least two parts; trailing `.*` only with `==` or `!=`; ASCII spaces around clauses or between operator and version, never inside versions | copier's validator, before rendering `config/project.json` `layers.backend.python` and `pyproject.toml` | Changes the minimum Python the project declares; check_H holds the two equal. A floor `toolchain_python` does not satisfy is refused by that question's validator. | the interpreter make runs: the make variable `PY` | always |
